DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ccffii device driver provides a management interface to NOR flash de‐
     vices supporting the Common Flash Interface (CFI) specification.  Its
     companion device ccffiidd provides a geom(4) disk interface to the device.

     Special support for features of the Intel StrataFlash line are available
     with the CCFFII__SSUUPPPPOORRTT__SSTTRRAATTAAFFLLAASSHH kernel option.  Additional support for
     write-once bits to switch part of Intel StrataFlash devices to read-only
     can be enabled by the CCFFII__AARRMMEEDDAANNDDDDAANNGGEERROOUUSS kernel option.

